    "Bookscroll imports each new EPUB, PDF, text, Markdown, HTML or RTF file in the folder and its subfolders when you open the app. A file is imported once. Removing a file from the folder does not delete the book, and a book you delete is not imported again. Books already in your library are skipped." : {},
